{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block page_title %}{{ 'Privacy Policy - KasKo Construction & Remodeling' }}{% endblock %}
{% block page_meta_description %}{{ 'Privacy policy for KasKo Construction & Remodeling.' }}{% endblock %}

{% block page_content %}

    {% embed 'layouts/right-sidebar.html.twig' %}

        {% block layout_page_title %}
            Privacy Policy
        {% endblock %}

        {% block layout_main_content %}
            <div class="col-12">
                <p>KasKo Construction & Remodeling respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we may collect through this website, how we use it, and the choices you have regarding your information.</p>

                <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
                <p>When you contact us or submit a quote request, you may provide information such as your name, phone number, email address, property address, project details, photos, or other information needed to understand and respond to your request.</p>

                <p>Our website may also collect basic technical information automatically, such as browser type, device information, IP address, referring page, and website activity. This information helps us operate, secure, and improve the website.</p>

                <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
                <p>We use the information you provide to respond to inquiries, prepare or discuss quotes, communicate about projects, schedule work, provide customer service, maintain business records, and operate our business.</p>

                <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

                <h3>Sharing Information</h3>
                <p>We may share information with trusted service providers when necessary to operate our website or business, such as website hosting, email, payment processing, accounting, or other administrative services. These providers receive only the information reasonably necessary to perform those services.</p>

                <p>We may also disclose information when required by law, to protect our rights or property, or when reasonably necessary to prevent fraud, misuse, or security problems.</p>

                <h3>Payments</h3>
                <p>If electronic payment options are provided, payment information is handled by the applicable third-party payment provider. KasKo does not intentionally store full credit card information on this website.</p>

                <h3>Cookies & Website Analytics</h3>
                <p>This website may use cookies or similar technologies that help the site function properly and help us understand how visitors use it. You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings, although some website features may not work as intended if cookies are disabled.</p>

                <h3>Security</h3>
                <p>We use reasonable administrative and technical measures to protect information submitted through this website. The site uses HTTPS encryption to protect information while it is transmitted between your browser and our server. No method of internet transmission or electronic storage, however, can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>

                <h3>Third-Party Links</h3>
                <p>Our website may contain links to websites or services operated by third parties. KasKo Construction & Remodeling is not responsible for the content, security, or privacy practices of those third-party sites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing personal information.</p>

                <h3>How Long We Keep Information</h3>
                <p>We keep information only as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose it was collected, to maintain appropriate business records, or to meet legal, accounting, or contractual requirements.</p>

                <h3>Your Choices</h3>
                <p>You may contact us to ask about personal information you have submitted through this website or to request that we correct or delete information when reasonably possible and not otherwise required for legitimate business or legal purposes.</p>

                <h3>Changes to This Policy</h3>
                <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes become effective when the revised policy is posted on this page.</p>

                <h3>Contact</h3>
                <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle information, please <a class="text-link" href="{{ path('contact') }}">contact us</a> or email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:{{ company_email }}">{{ company_email }}</a>.</p>
            </div>
        {% endblock %}

        {% block layout_sbr %}
            {% include 'components/forms/quote-request.html.twig' %}
            <div class="w-100 mb-3"></div>
            {% include 'components/testimonials.html.twig' %}
        {% endblock %}

    {% endembed %}

{% endblock %}
